    "updated_at": "2026-04-23T19:44:30Z",
    "body": "WebKit will likely be opposed to this: https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/41#issuecomment-4307350675. We don't think this is a good direction for the web and also believe that many of the main use cases driving this could be addressed by enhancements to the Media Session API.\r\n\r\nI also think OP is a tad misleading as my understanding is that neither Chromium nor Gecko supports this API on mobile.",
